<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hayom_yom_sheni/2"/>on which the Levites used to recite
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hayom_yom_sheni/3"/>in the Holy Temple:
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
